adjustments/
# Official daily archives share the governed data/histo tree. Keep the checked-in
# legacy demo partitions, but never commit runtime Risk/Colossus/Market snapshots.
data/histo/*/risk.csv
data/histo/*/colossus.csv
data/histo/*/market.csv
data/histo/*/_SUCCESS
# One explicitly marked, synthetic completed leaf is checked in so Validate P&L
# has a safe demo. These exact exceptions do not make runtime leaves trackable.
!data/histo/2026-08-10/risk.csv
!data/histo/2026-08-10/colossus.csv
!data/histo/2026-08-10/market.csv
!data/histo/2026-08-10/_SUCCESS
# The four existing legacy demo dates may also carry checked-in market history.
!data/histo/2026-08-11/market.csv
!data/histo/2026-08-12/market.csv
!data/histo/2026-08-13/market.csv
!data/histo/2026-08-14/market.csv
